data: {"id": "49b4ce25fd274c44-final", "run_id": "49b4ce25fd274c44", "seq": 1374, "ts_ms": 1788423005766, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod yaml配置引用了Secret 'aiops-case-04/workload-input'中不存在的key 'unavailable-key'（该Secret实际仅包含'available-key'），导致kubelet在创建容器前无法解析配置，从而触发CreateContainerConfigError。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: \"CreateContainerConfigError\" | 确认异常类别为配置缺失导致的容器启动阻断 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_message`: \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" | 定位具体缺失的资源标识符 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Event `Warning Failed`: \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" (x12 over 13m) | 持续重复发生的调度失败事实，印证配置解析错误 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status`: \"Pending\" | 确认 Pod 停留在预启动阶段，未进入运行或重启循环 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: \"CreateContainerConfigError\"): 1 | 独立监控指标确认容器处于等待状态 |\n\n以上 Kubernetes 事实（1, 2, 3, 4）与 Prometheus 指标（5）在“配置缺失导致容器处于 Waiting 状态”这一结论上完全一致，共同支撑根因判断。Logging/Tracing 因容器未启动而缺失，但不影响基于控制平面状态的定界。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod YAML 中引用了不存在的 Secret Key 'unavailable-key' (fact-2) \n  → Kubelet 创建容器前无法解析 Secret 配置 (fact-1, fact-3) \n  → 触发 CreateContainerConfigError (fact-1, fact-5) \n  → Pod 状态变为 Pending (fact-4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 的 YAML 配置引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`（事实 2），导致 Kubelet 在容器创建阶段无法解析环境变量或卷挂载配置，直接抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError`（事实 1）。这一配置错误导致容器无法启动，Pod 持续保持在 `Pending` 状态（事实 4），且 Prometheus 监控指标（事实 5）确认了该等待状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 52.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 52.2s (Evidence 45.9s, RCA 6.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 79.536, "metrics": {"run_id": "49b4ce25fd274c44", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 79.53844213485718, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 79538.44213485718, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 74120.0487613678, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 9904.757738113403, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4774.0092